<p>Make a cunning feint that tricks your target into swapping places with you.  While moving, you take the opportunity to trip them, pinning and dazing them for 2 turns.</p><p>Switching places distracts your foes and allows you to improve your defenses:  For <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns, Dual Weapon Mastery yields one extra parry each turn and you are <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 27%, 35%, 41%, 45%</acronym> less likely to miss your parry opportunities.</p><p>The chance to pin and to daze increases with your Accuracy</p>